  "prefLabel": "Plc 1309.04 Information Required for Renewal Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1309.04 Information Required for Renewal Application. An applicant for renewal of a license to practice a regulated MIRT profession shall provide the information required by Plc 308.06, provided that when identifying the profession for which application is being filed, the applicant shall identify the specific regulated MIRT profession in which the applicant is seeking license renewal.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
